#: ../data/photos.ansel.Ansel.appdata.xml.in.h:2
msgid ""
"Ansel manages your digital negatives in a database and lets you view them "
"through a lighttable. It also enables you to develop raw images and enhance "
"them in a darkroom."
msgstr ""
"Ansel gère vos négatifs numériques dans une base de données et vous permet "
"de les voir depuis la table lumineuse. Il permet aussi de développer et "
"d'améliorer les images numériques dans la chambre noire."

#: ../data/photos.ansel.Ansel.appdata.xml.in.h:3
msgid ""
"Editing is non-destructive: your original files are never modified. Every "
"adjustment is recorded as a history stack, stored in the database and in XMP "
"sidecar files, and replayed when the image is displayed or exported."
msgstr ""

#: ../data/photos.ansel.Ansel.appdata.xml.in.h:4
msgid ""
"The processing pipeline is scene-referred and fully colour-managed, so tonal "
"and colour adjustments behave predictably from the raw file to the exported "
"image, and can be accelerated on the GPU through OpenCL."
msgstr ""

